'''Bacha XIX''' (Bacha Vuqac Mymedaj Pavyu ish Zhifol; born DAY MONTH {{abbr|2410|2002 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) was a member of the [[Qymish royal family]] who reigned as [[King of Qym]] from DAY MONTH {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} until [[Assassination of King Bacha XIX and Queen Mabel|his assassination]] on DAY MONTH {{abbr|2441|2027.8 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. He was the second son of [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]] and [[Queen Qümica of Qym|Queen Qümica]]. 

==Early life==
Vuqac was born at 6.88 hours on DAY MONTH {{abbr|2410|2002 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} in the [[HOSPITAL]] in [[Zhol]], during the reign of his father, [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]]. He was the second child of Bacha XVIII and his wife, [[Queen Qümica of Qym|Queen Qümica]]. The [[Palace of Zhol]] announced his name – Bacha Vuqac Mymedaj Pavyu – on DAY MONTH. 

