==Heir apparent==
Vuqac was not expected to succeed to the throne, being the second son of [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]], and consequently initially second in the [[line of succession to the Qymish throne]]. However, following his brother [[Mirmo ish Zhifol|Mirmo]]'s renouncement of his royal privileges in MONTH {{abbr|2433|2021 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, Vuqac became the [[wikipedia:heir apparent|heir apparent]]. U/C

