==Personal life==
Vuqac was active on social media and had 31.3 million followers on [[SOCIAL MEDIA APP]] in MONTH {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. He posted pictures that showcased his hobbies, which included poker, playing hockey, hunting, snowmobiling and traveling. 

===Conversion to Ānism===
Vuqac's conversion to [[Ānism]] in {{abbr|2438|2025 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} generated a lot of controversy and became a political scandal in Qym. Previously a popular figure of the royal family, public approval plummeted rapidly in the predominantly [[Scildism|Scildist]] country. In a television interview in MONTH {{abbr|2438|2025 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, Vuqac attempted to reassure the public by stating his religious conversion was merely a personal one, and that he obviously recognized and respected the country's Scildist traditions and history. The interview had a positive effect on his ratings, rebounding to around 50% approval. 

===Relationship with Mabel Pegan===
In MONTH {{abbr|2439|2026 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, tabloid media published pictures of Vuqac with [[Mabel Pegan]], a [[NEIGHBORING COUNTRY]] citizen of mixed [[TBD people|TBD]]<!--East Asian--> and [[Genonian people|Genonian]] descent, in [[Teurek]]. The press widely speculated about a potential relationship with a foreigner and links to [[Transhumanism]] and [[Geno]]. Vuqac confirmed the relationship a month later and declared his intention to marry her. This led to heavier media scrutiny and speculation about [[Mabel Pegan]] being a [[Geno]]nian spy. Media attention became so intense that Vuqac told the press to keep their distance from [[Mabel Pegan]], leading to an intervention by [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]], and the imprisonment of several paparazzi for misinformation. The couple became engaged in MONTH (early) {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. 

===Feud with brother Mirmo===
In MONTH {{abbr|2438|2025 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, his brother [[Mirmo ish Zhifol|Mirmo]]'s rock band [[NAME TBD]] released an anti-religious song titled "TBD" (''God's servant'') which included critical lines regarding Vuqac's conversion to [[Ānism]]. Vuqac commented about the song on social media, stating it was "disrespectful and a shame". In MONTH {{abbr|2439|2026 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, [[Mirmo ish Zhifol|Mirmo]]'s rock band [[NAME TBD]] released a song titled "TBD" (''[[wikipedia:Honey trapping|honey trapping]]'') which alleged Vuqac was being manipulated by [[TBD]]. Vuqac once again went to social media to condemn the song lyrics and what he considers baseless accusations. He then accused his brother Mirmo of being racist and [[Āniphobia|Āniphobic]], as well as being a drug addict who slept with underage fans. 

